# Purpose
# Check generated HTML, CSS, and JavaScript markers after a Pages build.
#
# Common usage
# Run from the repository root.
# .\scripts\verify-pages-output.ps1
# .\scripts\verify-pages-output.ps1 -SkipBuild
#
# Useful options
# -SkipBuild checks the current _site folder without rebuilding.
#
# Recommended next command
# .\scripts\smoke-pages.ps1 -SkipBuild -Port 4000
#
# Notes
# Use this after build-pages.ps1 when you only need generated file checks.
# Use verify-pages.ps1 when you need the full verification chain.
